## 📁 Project Structure

```
Real-Estate-Analysis/
│── app/                # Streamlit app
│── model_selection/    # Training & model selection notebooks
│── data/               # Dataset files
│── README.md           # Project documentation
│── requirements.txt    # Dependencies
```

---

## ⚠️ Note on Model Files

Trained model files (`.pkl`) are **not included** in this repository due to GitHub file size limitations.

You can regenerate the model by running the training notebook/script provided in the project.

---

## 🧪 How to Run Locally

1. Clone the repository

```bash
git clone https://github.com/karansingh-chauhan/Real-Estate-Analysis.git
```

2. Install dependencies

```bash
pip install -r requirements.txt
```

3. Run the Streamlit app

```bash
streamlit run app/app.py
```

